<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Continuing Education Course Certification</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1 { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-row div { flex: 1; }
  .label { font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .input-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-height: 1em; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .checkbox-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .checkbox-group label { font-weight: normal; display: inline; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1>CONTINUING EDUCATION COURSE CERTIFICATION</h1>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Name:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">Student ID Number:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Title IV Loan Eligibility for Non-degree Students</div>
  <p>Non-degree students may be eligible for Federal Direct Loans. An academic or admissions advisor from the institution where the student plans to attend must complete this form and certify that the student met with them and developed a coursework outline for admission to their University. An academic or admissions advisor must determine that with successful completion of preparatory coursework, the student will be eligible to be considered for admission to the stated institution within twelve consecutive months. Please submit your form by mail or fax.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Academic Certification: Must be completed by Academic or Admissions Advisor</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Non-degree Start Term:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="start_term">{{ start_term }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">Year:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="start_year">{{ start_year }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="checkbox">
    <label>Degree Program: I certify that the student's anticipated courses meet the suggested additional preparation necessary for consideration for acceptance into a graduate program or second undergraduate program (form must be signed by academic / admissions advisor).</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Name of Institution:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Name of degree program to be considered for acceptance:</div>
  <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px;"><span data-field="degree_program_name">{{ degree_program_name }}</span></div>

  <div class="section-title">Please list the courses the student is required to take for admission:</div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">1.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses[0]">{{ required_courses[0] }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">2.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses[1]">{{ required_courses[1] }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">3.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses[2]">{{ required_courses[2] }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">4.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses[3]">{{ required_courses[3] }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="checkbox">
    <label>*Successful completion of this coursework does not guarantee admission into any degree program.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="checkbox">
    <label>Teacher (Re)Certification: (form must be signed by education academic advisor) I certify that the student's anticipated coursework meets the eligibility criteria required for elementary or secondary teacher certification or re-certification in the state where the student plans to teach, or the state where the student is completing the program. This exception is not intended to cover optional courses that the student elects to take for professional recognition or advancement. Nor does the exception cover courses that the school recommends but are not required for certification or re-certification.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Name of State:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="state_name">{{ state_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Name of Academic Institution:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="academic_institution_name">{{ academic_institution_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Please list the courses the student is required to take for admission:</div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">1.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses_2[0]">{{ required_courses_2[0] }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">2.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses_2[1]">{{ required_courses_2[1] }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">3.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses_2[2]">{{ required_courses_2[2] }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">4.</span>
        <div class="input-line"><span data-field="required_courses_2[3]">{{ required_courses_2[3] }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="checkbox">
    <label>*Successful completion of this coursework does not guarantee admission into any degree program.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Department:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="department">{{ department }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">Phone Number:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Name of Academic/Admissions Advisor (please print):</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="advisor_name">{{ advisor_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">Signature of Academic/Admissions Advisor:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="advisor_signature">{{ advisor_signature }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Date:</span>
      <div class="input-line"><span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; font-size: small; text-align: center;">
    <span data-field="institution_address">{{ institution_address }}</span><br>
    Email: <span data-field="institution_email">{{ institution_email }}</span> Web: <span data-field="institution_web">{{ institution_web }}</span> Phone: <span data-field="institution_phone">{{ institution_phone }}</span> Fax: <span data-field="institution_fax">{{ institution_fax }}</span>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>